---@field InstanceCreateTime? aws.neptune.TStamp Provides the date and time the DB instance was created.
---@field PreferredBackupWindow? aws.neptune.String Specifies the daily time range during which automated backups are created if automated backups are enabled, as determined by the BackupRetentionPeriod.
---@field BackupRetentionPeriod? aws.neptune.Integer Specifies the number of days for which automatic DB snapshots are retained.
---@field DBSecurityGroups? aws.neptune.DBSecurityGroupMembershipList Provides List of DB security group elements containing only DBSecurityGroup.Name and DBSecurityGroup.Status subelements.
---@field VpcSecurityGroups? aws.neptune.VpcSecurityGroupMembershipList Provides a list of VPC security group elements that the DB instance belongs to.
---@field DBParameterGroups? aws.neptune.DBParameterGroupStatusList Provides the list of DB parameter groups applied to this DB instance.
---@field AvailabilityZone? aws.neptune.String Specifies the name of the Availability Zone the DB instance is located in.
---@field DBSubnetGroup? aws.neptune.DBSubnetGroup Specifies information on the subnet group associated with the DB instance, including the name, description, and subnets in the subnet group.
---@field PreferredMaintenanceWindow? aws.neptune.String Specifies the weekly time range during which system maintenance can occur, in Universal Coordinated Time (UTC).
---@field PendingModifiedValues? aws.neptune.PendingModifiedValues Specifies that changes to the DB instance are pending. This element is only included when changes are pending. Specific changes are identified by subelements.
---@field LatestRestorableTime? aws.neptune.TStamp Specifies the latest time to which a database can be restored with point-in-time restore.
---@field MultiAZ? aws.neptune.Boolean Specifies if the DB instance is a Multi-AZ deployment.
