---@field ReadReplicaDBClusterIdentifiers? aws.neptune.ReadReplicaDBClusterIdentifierList Contains one or more identifiers of DB clusters that are Read Replicas of this DB instance.
---@field LicenseModel? aws.neptune.String License model information for this DB instance.
---@field Iops? aws.neptune.IntegerOptional Specifies the Provisioned IOPS (I/O operations per second) value.
---@field OptionGroupMemberships? aws.neptune.OptionGroupMembershipList (Not supported by Neptune)
---@field CharacterSetName? aws.neptune.String (Not supported by Neptune)
