---@field PubliclyAccessible? aws.neptune.Boolean Indicates whether the DB instance is publicly accessible.
---@field StatusInfos? aws.neptune.DBInstanceStatusInfoList The status of a Read Replica. If the instance is not a Read Replica, this is blank.
---@field StorageType? aws.neptune.String Specifies the storage type associated with the DB instance.
---@field TdeCredentialArn? aws.neptune.String The ARN from the key store with which the instance is associated for TDE encryption.
---@field DbInstancePort? aws.neptune.Integer Specifies the port that the DB instance listens on. If the DB instance is part of a DB cluster, this can be a different port than the DB cluster port.
---@field DBClusterIdentifier? aws.neptune.String If the DB instance is a member of a DB cluster, contains the name of the DB cluster that the DB instance is a member of.
---@field StorageEncrypted? aws.neptune.Boolean Not supported: The encryption for DB instances is managed by the DB cluster.
---@field KmsKeyId? aws.neptune.String Not supported: The encryption for DB instances is managed by the DB cluster.
---@field DbiResourceId? aws.neptune.String The Amazon Region-unique, immutable identifier for the DB instance. This identifier is found in Amazon CloudTrail log entries whenever the Amazon KMS key for the DB instance is accessed.
---@field CACertificateIdentifier? aws.neptune.String The identifier of the CA certificate for this DB instance.
---@field DomainMemberships? aws.neptune.DomainMembershipList Not supported
---@field CopyTagsToSnapshot? aws.neptune.Boolean Specifies whether tags are copied from the DB instance to snapshots of the DB instance.
---@field MonitoringInterval? aws.neptune.IntegerOptional The interval, in seconds, between points when Enhanced Monitoring metrics are collected for the DB instance.
