---@field PromotionTier? aws.neptune.IntegerOptional A value that specifies the order in which a Read Replica is promoted to the primary instance after a failure of the existing primary instance.
---@field DBInstanceArn? aws.neptune.String The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) for the DB instance.
---@field Timezone? aws.neptune.String Not supported.
---@field IAMDatabaseAuthenticationEnabled? aws.neptune.Boolean True if Amazon Identity and Access Management (IAM) authentication is enabled, and otherwise false.
---@field PerformanceInsightsEnabled? aws.neptune.BooleanOptional (Not supported by Neptune)
---@field PerformanceInsightsKMSKeyId? aws.neptune.String (Not supported by Neptune)
---@field EnabledCloudwatchLogsExports? aws.neptune.LogTypeList A list of log types that this DB instance is configured to export to CloudWatch Logs.
---@field DeletionProtection? aws.neptune.BooleanOptional Indicates whether or not the DB instance has deletion protection enabled. The instance can't be deleted when deletion protection is enabled. See Deleting a DB Instance.
---@field NetworkType? aws.neptune.String The network type of the DB instance. Inherited from the DB cluster.

