---@field PreferredBackupWindow? aws.neptune.String The daily time range during which automated backups are created if automated backups are enabled, using the BackupRetentionPeriod parameter.
---@field PreferredMaintenanceWindow? aws.neptune.String The weekly time range during which system maintenance can occur, in Universal Coordinated Time (UTC).
---@field EnableIAMDatabaseAuthentication? aws.neptune.BooleanOptional True to enable mapping of Amazon Identity and Access Management (IAM) accounts to database accounts, and otherwise false.
---@field CloudwatchLogsExportConfiguration? aws.neptune.CloudwatchLogsExportConfiguration The configuration setting for the log types to be enabled for export to CloudWatch Logs for a specific DB cluster. See Using the CLI to publish Neptune audit logs to CloudWatch Logs.
